      "value": "There should be no NSFW content in VRChat whatsoever. I know for sure that sexual roleplay is one of a few reasons VRChat is maintaining a huge part of their audience, but it should not be allowed, according to the ToS, they even have a paragraph stating that \"role-playing is not an excuse.\" However, I definitely agree that we could use more information about users, like age, birthday. location, local time, maybe bio, etc.",
      "viewerReactions": null
