  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": ";tldr? Add an optional show age, DOB, or 18+ icon in public profile to avoid questionable situations.\nI am aware that this platform has under-aged individuals on it. At times it can be difficult to know if the person you are talking to is under the legal age in their location. I am sure you all are aware that voices can be deceiving, and it’s not like you can physically see the person IRL while in VR. Also, it can be difficult at times to remember the ages or birthdays of 30+ individuals in your friends list. I am mostly asking for this feature to prevent underage individuals from getting into inappropriate situations. I also believe that this puts liability on the individual user(s) and not VRChat in protecting its user base by allowing users to make informed decisions.",
